## Executes the macro calls of the content edited with BlockNote, so that the editor can show the output of the macro
## calls that were inserted or modified, by the current user or by the other users editing the same content in realtime.
## All the macro calls are executed because the output of a macro call can depend on the rest of the content. The
## request is sent to the document where the edited content is saved, which is the context of the macro calls. When it
## indicates a realtime collaboration session (the "collaboration" request parameter), the content is executed with the
## rights of the session participant with the least script rights among those that changed the content.
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
